{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil creatures are crawling out from the depths, and your castle stands as the last bastion of hope! In Poly Lands, you\u2019ll battle relentless waves of enemies across vibrant low-poly worlds, using towers, troops, spells, and heroes to forge your perfect defense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your towers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your defense your way - build, upgrade, or even destroy towers mid-battle to adapt to ever-changing enemy threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command unique heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead powerful heroes with distinct abilities and playstyles, turning desperate defenses into decisive victories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use powerfull spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call down devastating magic at the perfect moment to control the battlefield and wipe out overwhelming enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567520/extras/a7e7d322b9039b1bb25ed5b2d628e489.poster.avif?t=1774186541\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567520/extras/a7e7d322b9039b1bb25ed5b2d628e489.webm?t=1774186541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567520/extras/a7e7d322b9039b1bb25ed5b2d628e489.mp4?t=1774186541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore colorfull levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend across vibrant low-poly levels, each with unique layouts, challenges, and tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567520/extr